msgstr "स्तम्भका सङ्ख्याहरू:"

#. i18n: file: scripts/tablewizard.kmdr:167
#. i18n: file: scripts/tablewizard.kmdr:289
#. i18n: file: scripts/tablewizard.kmdr:167
#. i18n: file: scripts/tablewizard.kmdr:289
#: rc.cpp:3012 rc.cpp:3036
msgid ""
"Select or enter in this spin box the number of columns that should be "
"created by the wizard."
msgstr ""
"विजार्डद्वारा सिर्जना गरिनुपर्ने स्तम्भका सङ्ख्या यो स्पिनबाकसमा प्रविष्ट गर्नुहोस् वा चयन "
